00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:18,080
Vector search finds meaning with filters applied inside that search.

230
00:22:18,446 --> 00:22:26,116
Keyword search finds exact strings such as gene names or drug codes, and then we merge the rankings with reciprocal rank fusion.

231
00:22:26,734 --> 00:22:30,800
And that timing that we measure is measured inside the engine.

